fects and a round of monster fixes, in time for Steam Next Fest (October 19–26).What’s newNew interactions with rats, including for players in rat form. Tamed rats grow more attached the more you feed them.New item: Chili Pepper.New item","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-17T09:35:37Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706684196","verified_at":"2026-10-20T18:26:43Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4891550-1846018067936053","game_id":"steam-4891550","kind":"update","title":"Demo Update 1.0.15","summary":"New ContentThe colored pills have a new effect.Rats have a new behavior.Every room now has its own reverb.The Zombie Maid’s jaw now moves when she makes a sound.The DO NOT PRESS, BEWARE and REVIVE signs and the GOALS whiteboard are now translated into all 12 languages.Balance & ImprovementsAfter a wipe, RESTART now starts the group in the safe room once the spike ceiling puzzle is solved.The Interact key hint now stays next to the crosshair for the whole run.Monsters can now hit players standing","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-10T11:35:12Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846018067936053","verified_at":"2026-10-20T18:26:43Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4891550-1846018067926176","game_id":"steam-4891550","kind":"update","title":"Demo Update 1.0.14","summary":"New ContentThe Zombie Maid has been remade with a brand-new look.Explosions and flashbangs now light up the room around them.Players' jaws now move while they talk in voice chat.Players' bellies now jiggle.Added a LEFT-HANDED LAYOUT button to the Controls settings.The end screen now shows each player's deaths.Balance & ImprovementsThe Reanimator's buff now lasts until death.The Radio is now called the Walkie-Talkie.Trying to pick up something you can't hold now tells you why, and the crosshair s","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-07T13:41:47Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846018067926176","verified_at":"2026-10-20T18:26:43Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4891550-1845383656387083","game_id":"steam-4891550","kind":"update","title":"Demo Update 1.0.13","summary":"Fat Chance — Update 1.0.13This update adds a new potion, a mystery pill and a new secret, and fixes a batch of revive and co-op issues.New ContentAdded the Telepathy Potion.Added an unmarked pill. Its colour and effect change from run to run.Added a new secret to discover.Added cobwebs, claw marks and floor scuffs to parts of the mansion.Balance & ImprovementsThe Transformation Potion now also appears in solo runs.The Rusty Flashlight now flickers.The Reanimator can now revive a crushed teammate","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-02T16:58:39Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1845383656387083","verified_at":"2026-10-20T18:26:43Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4891550-1844751498231390","game_id":"steam-4891550","kind":"update","title":"Demo Update 1.0.12","summary":"Fat Chance — Update 1.0.12This update improves item availability, enemy movement, and item drops, alongside a few visual and setup improvements.Balance & ImprovementsIncreased the availability of Shrink and Strength pills.Refined potion outlines.Updated rat visual details.Fallen ceiling fan blades now disappear shortly after settling.Updated the first-time setup to recommend the in-game proximity voice chat.Bug FixesFixed enemies walking backwards while investigating noises.Fixed rats getting st","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-28T12:45:32Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1844751498231390","verified_at":"2026-10-20T18:26:43Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4891550-1844751498229712","game_id":"steam-4891550","kind":"update","title":"Demo Update 1.0.11","summary":"Fat Chance — Update 1.0.11This update brings a new potion, a new secret to discover, and more ways to bring your teammates back. We’ve also improved item effects, combat feedback, and several co-op issues.New ContentAdded the Transformation Potion to co-op runs.Added a new secret to discover.Added a slide cooldown indicator beside the hotbar.Added voice effects that respond to your character’s size and transformations.Expanded rat behavior and animations.Balance & ImprovementsReanimator can now ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-27T18:04:53Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1844751498229712","verified_at":"2026-10-20T18:26:43Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4891550-1844751498221774","game_id":"steam-4891550","kind":"update","title":"Demo Update 1.0.10","summary":"Fat Chance — Update 1.0.10This update adds shirt customization, more details around the mansion, and new interactions to discover. It also improves sound, resurrection effects, and several gameplay and interface issues.New ContentAdded shirt color selection in the lobby.Added new rugs around the mansion.Expanded rat behavior with more interactions to discover.Balance & ImprovementsReanimator revivals now bring severed body parts back together.Added room-specific echoes and reverb.You can now boo","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-24T14:52:23Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1844751498221774","verified_at":"2026-10-20T18:26:43Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4891550-1844751498218737","game_id":"steam-4891550","kind":"update","title":"Demo Update 1.0.9","summary":"Fat Chance — Update 1.0.9This update adds new items and a few surprises around the mansion, alongside camera options and multiplayer fixes. Thanks for playing the demo! Here’s what’s changed:New ContentRats now have new behaviors and interactions to discover.Added cheese as a new item.Added throwable eggs that shatter on impact and make noise to distract enemies.Added the Reanimator syringe: inject yourself or a teammate to gain a temporary effect that revives them if they die while it is active","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-23T15:09:53Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1844751498218737","verified_at":"2026-10-20T18:26:43Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4891550-1844115010504109","game_id":"steam-4891550","kind":"update","title":"Demo Update 1.0.8","summary":"Fat Chance Demo — Update 1.0.8This update brings new ways to move and express yourself, more inventory space for solo players, and improvements around the mansion. Thanks for playing the demo! Here’s what’s changed:New ContentAdded a dash and steerable belly slide, complete with new animations and sound effects.Added wave, pointing, and middle-finger emotes with customizable key bindings.Added a new rat color variant.Balance & ImprovementsIncreased inventory capacity in solo play.Doors now swing","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-22T12:56:23Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1844115010504109","verified_at":"2026-10-20T18:26:43Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4891550-1844115010500973","game_id":"steam-4891550","kind":"update","title":"Demo Update 1.0.7","summary":"This update opens up a part of the mansion that used to be walled off, and fixes a few co-op issues.New ContentRemoved the invisible wall on the bridge. There is something to find on the other side now.ImprovementsSolo runs now start with five lives instead of three.Bug FixesFixed clients ending up with no menu at all after returning to the lobby from a run.Fixed dropping an item also dropping your equipped gear in co-op.Fixed prop collision that made items resting on a table impossible to pick ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-21T10:26:14Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1844115010500973","verified_at":"2026-10-20T18:26:43Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4891550-1844115010499089","game_id":"steam-4891550","kind":"update","title":"Demo Update 1.0.6","summary":"Another small hotfix.Bug FixesFixed numbers in the HUD showing up as broken squares when the game language is set to SYSTEM on a Windows install with an unsupported system language, such as Arabic. The game now falls back to English instead.","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-20T15:12:20Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1844115010499089","verified_at":"2026-10-20T18:26:43Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4891550-1844115010498589","game_id":"steam-4891550","kind":"update","title":"Demo Update 1.0.5","summary":"A small hotfix for a shadow bug.Bug FixesFixed characters and monsters casting a black smear on the floor instead of a real shadow on graphics cards without hardware ray tracing.","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-20T09:08